# The monthly job used to write data/mp_data_fetched.json here and then
# `git add` it — an ignored path, so the step failed every time. Phase 5 removed
# both halves of that: the fetch now writes data/*.json (what the app reads) and
# the change report goes to the runner's temp dir, never into the tree.
